      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَرِيبَةٌ</span></b>  fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَرِيبٌ</span> [q. v.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence, as a
subst.,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الغَرِيبَةُ</span> signifies (tropical:)  <i>The hand-mill:</i> so called
